---
import BaseLayout from "../../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Shredder | Arman Mishra Projects" description="Shredder, a Python reconnaissance and service-enumeration tool by Arman Mishra.">
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">PROJECT / 001 · RECONNAISSANCE TOOLING</div>
    <h1>Shredder<span class="hero-accent">Discovery first. Evidence-led triage.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">A Python-based reconnaissance and service-enumeration tool built to make initial discovery fast, structured, and useful.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/enkidudev/shredder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View GitHub repository <span>↗</span></a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects/">All projects <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container section content-layout">
    <aside class="side-note"><span>DESIGN PRINCIPLE</span><strong>Scan fast. Enumerate deeply. Triage with evidence.</strong></aside>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What it does</h2>
      <p>Shredder automates fast port discovery and structured service enumeration. Its workflow combines RustScan-based discovery with Nmap fingerprinting and script-based enumeration, then organizes results for review.</p>
      <h2>Core ideas</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fast discovery profiles for authorized targets.</li>
        <li>Service fingerprinting and default script enumeration.</li>
        <li>Optional deeper NSE checks.</li>
        <li>Evidence-based triage rules that explain why a lead matters.</li>
        <li>Organized output to support review and reporting.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Technology</h2>
      <div class="tag-list tag-list-light"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">RustScan</span><span class="tag">Nmap</span><span class="tag">NSE</span></div>
      <h2>Repository</h2>
      <p>The source code and current release information are maintained on GitHub.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/enkidudev/shredder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/enkidudev/shredder <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
